warning=This plugin sends your character name, account type and combat level, worn equipment, inventory, bank and other item storage, skills, quest, achievement diary, combat achievement, current Slayer assignment and other slayer, clue, minigame, music, pet and other game progress values, collection log, kill counts, Grand Exchange offers, and in-game location to osrsindex.com, a website not controlled or verified by the RuneLite Developers. It sends nothing about your character until you click "Link with osrsindex.com" in its panel: that click sends your character name to get a link code, and syncing starts once you approve the link on the site. When you open its Guides tab, it downloads guides from osrsindex.com, linked or not, without sending your character data. Once linked, it also reads sync settings and notices from osrsindex.com, which can pause what is sent or choose which progress values are sent, and it receives the map places you send from your osrsindex.com account and passes them to the Shortest Path plugin, unless you turn off "Receive destinations".
